name    mod-kill-collector: the achievements stack to +25% damage, the 45th completes "N3rd"
# Server-side test bot run (mod-fl-testbots), T1. Needs KillCollector.Enable = 1, KillCollector.AchievementsEnable = 1,
# KillCollector.DamageBonusPct = 5 and KillCollector.MetaAchievementId = 30051 (the defaults), the module's SQL and
# this folder in TestBots.ScenarioDirs. The combat log numbers are those of kill_collector_bonus: spell 37463
# ("Fireball") is 4000 fixed damage, so 4000 * (100 + 5 * n) / 100 with n earned Oddities achievements.
#
# Part 1, the kill path: a fresh warlock (slot 3 = Tblocc on TBOT03; `.reset achievements` clears it) gets 44 of the
# 45 achievements from a game master (`.achievement add`, all but Oddities of the Forgotten Land). The Oddities
# are four of five lists: +20% against them (the other types +25%), so the spell does 4800 on an Enchanted Zol'maz
# weapon, and "N3rd" is not there yet (44 of 45). The director then kills the three Oddities of the Forgotten
# Land with the bot in the party (as kill_collector_achievement does): the 45th achievement completes, the module
# grants "N3rd" at once, the spell does 5000.
#
# Part 2, the login path: the character is reset and gets all 45 from the game master. Nothing completes the
# meta achievement on that path ("N3rd: not yet (45 of 45 achievements)"), the next login does (`relog`): the
# status line says "N3rd: earned". The title itself (CharTitles 178, bit 143 = bit 15 of the 5th number of
# `characters.knownTitles`) is saved at logout: check it after the run.
#
# The character must hold none of the achievements when the run starts: the first step resets them. For another run
# in the same state pick another slot (`slot=4` is Tblocd, ...); the name in the `.achievement add` lines follows.
timeout 400s

bot c warlock slot=3
group party

log 1 - a clean start, then 44 of the 45 achievements from the game master
place 727 12286.3 11701.4 -83.7
require c alive
do gm target c
as gm .killcollector reset
expect output has "collection reset"
as gm .reset achievements Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30001 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30002 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30003 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30004 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30005 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30006 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30007 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30009 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30010 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30011 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30012 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30013 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30014 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30015 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30016 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30017 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30019 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30020 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30021 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30022 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30023 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30024 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30025 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30026 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30027 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30029 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30030 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30031 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30032 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30033 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30034 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30035 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30036 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30037 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30039 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30040 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30041 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30042 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30043 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30044 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30045 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30046 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30047 Tblocc
as gm .achievement add 30049 Tblocc
as c .killcollector status
expect output has "+25% beasts"
expect output has "+25% mechanicals"
expect output has "+20% oddities"
expect output has "N3rd: not yet (44 of 45 achievements)"

log 2 - four Oddities lists: the spell does 4800
pick w1 creature:86156 near c
do gm target w1
as gm .respawn
wait 1s
pick w1 creature:86156 near c
require w1 alive
do c approach w1
wait 1s
spelllog start
do c cast 37463 on w1 triggered
wait 1s
spelllog stop
expect c spell 37463 damage == 4800

log 3 - the 45th achievement: the director completes Oddities of the Forgotten Land (Poisonous Mushroom, Void Stone, Enchanted Zol'maz weapon)
place 727 13392.6 11411.4 -148.5
pick m creature:30435 near c
do gm target m
as gm .respawn
wait 1s
pick m creature:30435 near c
require m alive
do c approach m
wait 1s
do gm target m
as gm .damage 1000000
waitfor m dead timeout 5s
wait 1s

place 727 13711.4 11947.7 -49
pick v creature:86123 near c
do gm target v
as gm .respawn
wait 1s
pick v creature:86123 near c
require v alive
do c approach v
wait 1s
do gm target v
as gm .damage 1000000
waitfor v dead timeout 5s
wait 1s

place 727 12044.3 11658.8 -85.3
pick k creature:86156 near c
do gm target k
as gm .respawn
wait 1s
pick k creature:86156 near c
require k alive
do c approach k
wait 1s
do gm target k
as gm .damage 1000000
waitfor k dead timeout 5s
wait 1s
as c .killcollector status
expect output has "1 of 9 achievements"
expect output has "+25% oddities"
expect output has "N3rd: earned"

log 4 - five Oddities lists: the spell does 5000
place 727 12215.6 11687.8 -84.2
pick w2 creature:86156 near c
do gm target w2
as gm .respawn
wait 1s
pick w2 creature:86156 near c
require w2 alive
do c approach w2
wait 1s
spelllog start
do c cast 37463 on w2 triggered
wait 1s
spelllog stop
expect c spell 37463 damage == 5000

